    {
      "id": "1DulrjUJV712i4WoHWYQG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1043.9921875,
      "y": 980.35546875,
      "width": 388.3996276855469,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1182292792,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1341420856,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785687906858,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is -> NV = (N1 + N2 + N3 + N4) / 4",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is -> NV = (N1 + N2 + N3 + N4) / 4",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "E2upTNInNrk9a9kZxGBXd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 326.07925435204635,
      "y": 1263.420124880791,
      "width": 742.79931640625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2129453112,
      "version": 109,
      "versionNonce": 678777928,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785687992652,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "And, with the normals of the vertices, how do we calculate in one fragment?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And, with the normals of the vertices, how do we calculate in one fragment?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Me_jU2PuZ9-3CdaEvQtsO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 394.39793986195133,
      "y": 1321.0794233904446,
      "width": 941.3190307617188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1498604104,
      "version": 129,
      "versionNonce": 230191176,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785688026140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Easy -> We interpolate (using barycentric coordinates) the light intensity in each of the vertex.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Easy -> We interpolate (using barycentric coordinates) the light intensity in each of the vertex.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7sQowRolWZlK2G8XjLL8_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1684.0952954582694,
      "y": 752.9807317219274,
      "width": 1856.4773906060204,
      "height": 79.41272559547038,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1803160648,
      "version": 111,
      "versionNonce": 314485320,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785688094110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THERE ARE MORE WAYS OF CALCULATING THE NORMAL!",
      "fontSize": 63.5301804763763,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THERE ARE MORE WAYS OF CALCULATING THE NORMAL!",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ge88OgW7-tUJ4W0bw-FuX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2049.062709316813,
      "y": 878.3314115080913,
      "width": 995.9990844726562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 901691464,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 350246472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785688117027,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The important thing of this algorithm is using the normals of vertices intead of the normals of faces",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The important thing of this algorithm is using the normals of vertices intead of the normals of faces",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VRR4r9ceeJEazBgu4Dw0E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 265.2863600059063,
      "y": 1382.31773117455,
      "width": 2314.3434675182198,
      "height": 60.621784146259856,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1803118920,
      "version": 185,
      "versionNonce": 1475188296,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785688416825,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The question is: in which step of the graphics pipeline the normals of the vertices are calculated?",
      "fontSize": 48.497427317007855,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The question is: in which step of the graphics pipeline the normals of the vertices are calculated?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "q_Exq-LjQ5kIHKqvDYRXb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 429.978869650404,
      "y": 1507.865212657605,
      "width": 1530.14501953125,
      "height": 194.15642917482955,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ab",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 354591816,
      "version": 334,
      "versionNonce": 1901478728,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785688493951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In no one. The normals of the vertex must come with the vertex in the VBO.\n\nThis is because the EBO is only used by the primitive assembly, whose job is not calculating normals.\n\nSo, in our implementation, the normals must come in the VertexIn.",
      "fontSize": 31.06502866797273,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In no one. The normals of the vertex must come with the vertex in the VBO.\n\nThis is because the EBO is only used by the primitive assembly, whose job is not calculating normals.\n\nSo, in our implementation, the normals must come in the VertexIn.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
